  what you asked for; the alternative is shipping an untestable invariant, which I'd rather not do silently.

  [3m[38;5;153mapp.mjs[39m gets no tests.[0m Unit-testing DOM wiring needs jsdom, a dependency you didn't ask for. The mitigation is keeping
